  "limits": [
    "the SOCKS login is service-wide: if BD rotates it, auth starts returning 01 ff and the new pair must be re-captured (proxy their libxray -> their dnstt port)",
    "TCP only through the relay (no UDP ASSOCIATE); Telegram falls back to TCP",
    "speed is DNS-tunnel speed: ~129 KB/s down measured, fine for pages/Telegram, not for video",
    "binaries come from BD's public APK at build time, they are not committed"
  ]
